  "result_notes": {
    "u/thm:main": "Known n>=2,rational retention p and ordinary independent binary deletion traces;per-string success>=2/3. M=ceil exp(CB),uniform bit time(n+L+M)^c for EVERY well-formed stream/internal random sequence;input/output/preprocessing charged. p=1 branch one trace/default. Constants absolute but not practical values.",
    "u/lem:moment-bounds": "Boolean sign moment matrix PSD of orderD implies all moments up to2D bounded by1;polynomial functional Hermitian/Cauchy-Schwarz after quotient. Feasible array need not be a distribution.",
    "u/thm:separation": "Every PSD moment completion fixing correct prefix then one wrong bit has some NONLOCAL rank-product expectation gap>exp(-Csep B);D>=4^(ceil log2Y+H). This is stronger than separation of actual input strings.",
    "u/prop:multiscale": "Orderk feature,4k<=D,sector|omega|<=2.002s,and explicit height/error/scale hypotheses. One step order<=4k,signal exp(-7.98E),controlled new gap factors/height;analytic existence,not witness-search runtime.",
    "u/lem:cauchy-matching": "Positive matching measure along prescribed real difference,marginal sum dominated by Cauchy density;2mass=1-4/pi atan(exp(-pi/r));r0mass1/2. Not an independent pair-sampling oracle.",
    "u/lem:good-frequencies": "Cauchy logarithmic deficit<=1.001E,center<=2.003s gives one frequency within2s deficit2.40E and bounded prescribed-difference pairs deficit2.74E.",
    "u/lem:gram-chain": "Complex Hilbert vectors with squared norm and adjacent inner products withinxi of1 give endpoint inner product error<=2J^2xi. Does not certify arbitrary nonPSD pseudo-moments.",
    "u/lem:balanced-product": "Under multiscale hypotheses a product of1..4 windowed Fourier sums/conjugates with small total frequency has discrepancy>=exp(-7.94E);positivity and Gram chain required.",
    "u/lem:edge-gap-assignment": "Connected ordered multigraph admits distinct crossing edge per consecutive vertex gap,via spanning-tree incidence determinant. Avoids overcharging damping under tuple interleavings.",
    "u/lem:product-cayley": "At mostN damped exponential factors with a>=gamma min(|theta|,N theta²) give positive quantitative Cayley half-plane margin c gamma. No deletion-model-free statistical guarantee.",
    "u/lem:prefix-slack": "On one empirical-good event all wrong next-bit prefixes infeasible;correct prefix mixtures withuniform signs givePSD slackzeta/8 andstatisticalslack. Data-adaptiveprefixes use sameuniform event.",
    "u/lem:rational-feasibility": "Exact rational affine/Boolean-moment PSD feasibility with dyadiczeta:bounded procedure alwayshalts,accepts only validvector,guaranteedacceptONLYifslacksolutionexists. capceil10(1+l)/lambda²,lambda=zeta/(16G);notgeneralSDPdecision.",
    "l/thm:main": "For fixeds>0,c<1/(4log2),along EVERY varying-channel sequence n->infty,q³logn->infty,eventually Tq,s(n)>=n^(c log(q³logn)). Fixed-budget unrestricted estimator,deterministicbinaryinput/completeindependenttraces. No finite usable threshold.",
    "l/thm:tv": "At eachfixedq,minimumone-traceTV between distinctlengthnwords is smaller than everyinversepower alongalllargen;samplecomplexitybeats everyfixedpower foranyfixeds>0. Not everyinputpair/average-inputclaim.",
    "l/lem:scale-margins": "Backwardscales,preliminaryb2 thenBblocks anddelta^-3 channelcost haveuniformsmallestscale/absorption margins onlyjointasymptoticdelta³logn->infty;deltafixedinsideinstance.",
    "l/prop:construction": "Allinductionlevels existwithdistinctequal-lengthwordpairs,auxiliarylikelihoodscore,commonpostprocessingerrors,andadjacentpoweroverlap. Existentialasymptoticconstructor,nopracticalhardinstancegenerator supplied.",
    "l/lem:moment": "Independentcenteredrealvariables,evenmomentt,nosymmetry/iidrequired;degree-rmultilinearscore L^t <=(C t h)^r coefficientl2. Independenceisessential.",
    "l/lem:lift": "Adjacentword-poweroverlapomega andsufficientF>=CkP,C>=Cabs/omega giveoverlap>=2/3 forpowersFPandFP+P;requireslargeP,notfreehiddenorientationoracle.",
